{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "וכל זקני", :translit "v'chol ziknei", :gloss "and all the elders of"} {:he "וכל זקני פרעה", :translit "v'chol ziknei par'oh", :gloss "and all the elders of Pharaoh"} {:he "ויבא אהרן וכל זקני ישראל לאכל לחם", :translit "yavo aharon v'chol ziknei yisra'el le'echol lechem", :gloss "and Aaron came and all the elders of Israel to eat bread"} {:he "וכל זקני העיר ההיא", :translit "v'chol ziknei ha'ir ha'hi", :gloss "and all the elders of that city"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["וכל זקני פרעה" "ויבא אהרן וכל זקני ישראל לאכל לחם" "וכל זקני העיר ההיא"]} {:kind :other, :note "The three occurrences map onto the two obligations of the broken-necked heifer rite: feeding and escorting the wayfarer."}], :frame {:text "In the rite of the broken-necked heifer (eglah arufah), the elders of the nearest city must declare 'Our hands did not shed this blood, and our eyes did not see' (Deuteronomy 21:7). The Mishnah asks whether this implies they are suspected of murder; rather, they declare they did not send him off without food or escort — as stated in Sotah 45b–46a. Ba'al HaTurim links the three Masorah occurrences of וכל זקני to these two obligations: the elders of Israel feeding (Exodus 18:12) fulfills the obligation of provisions, and the elders of Pharaoh who escorted Jacob's coffin (Genesis 50:7) fulfills the obligation of escort.", :sources ["Deuteronomy 21:7" "Sotah 45b–46a" "Exodus 18:12" "Genesis 50:7"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["וכל זקני פרעה" "ויבא אהרן וכל זקני ישראל לאכל לחם" "וכל זקני העיר ההיא"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "וכל זקני פרעה", :refs [], :n 0, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "ויבא אהרן וכל זקני ישראל לאכל לחם", :refs ["Exodus 18:12"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "וכל זקני העיר ההיא", :refs ["Deuteronomy 21:6"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive}]} {:kind :other, :note "The three occurrences map onto the two obligations of the broken-necked heifer rite: feeding and escorting the wayfarer.", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:12:41.654493441Z", :model "glm-5.2"}